# Commit messages

You MUST write all git commit messages in Simplified Chinese (简体中文).

Match this repository's existing style:
- Prefer a short one-line subject (about one sentence).
- Focus on why/what changed at a high level, not a file list.
- Do not write commit messages in English unless the user explicitly asks.

Examples of the desired style:
- 拆分 toolbar 模块
- 修复打开设置/预览时因根节点切换导致的卡顿
- 简化窗口内导航：内部路径地址栏 + toolbar 使用 PathBuf
